OL,3,GNEWSASure vows better mobile coverage
OL,4,Aafter complaints
OL,5,
OL,6,FMobile network provider Sure has said
OL,7,Fit is tackling customer complaints
OL,8,Fabout dropped calls, unreliable signals
OL,9,Fand mobile data issues in Jersey.
OL,11,FSome customers have experienced
OL,12,Fdisruption and the mobile experience
OL,13,Fhad "not been good enough" for some
OL,14,Fpeople on the island, said Sure.
OL,16,FSure is investing #48m in its 5G
OL,17,Fupgrade across Guernsey and Jersey,
OL,18,Fwith hopes to bring higher data speeds
OL,19,Fand better coverage to islanders.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
